      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَانَهُ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَبُونُ</span>, (S in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بين</span>, Msb, K,) inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَوْنٌ</span>, (Msb, TA,) <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَانَهُ</span> aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَبِينُ</span>, (S ubi
suprà K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيْنٌ</span>, (TA,) meaning <i>He excelled
